GitLab had no Notes API actions and no single merge request read, so an agent could not read or answer a GitLab issue or merge request thread. Adds get_merge_request, list_issue_notes, create_issue_note, list_merge_request_notes and create_merge_request_note following the provider's existing path, pagination and error helpers, with schemas from GitLab's Notes and Merge Requests API docs and handler tests for the request mapping.
